      "created_at": "2016-04-27T13:36:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I know OblivAeon is still a year in the making, but I can't help looking further into the future. If the multiverse ends with OblivAeon, I'm actually ok with it. What I'd love to see when they are finished though is some card enhancements when they get around to reprinting.</p><p>Some enhancements I was thinking about are:</p><p>1. New card art for the older decks to take advantage of the incredible&nbsp;improvement in&nbsp;Adam's skill since this game was first released. Expatriette's eye patch on Pride(Prejudice?) stands out.</p><p>2.&nbsp;I would love the cards to have the little icons you see in the video game. Those things have made playing Argent Adept soooo much easier.</p>",
